  "body": "Sections size from 450sqm to 550sqm\r\nTitle issue soon. selling fast\r\n\r\nif you got a section, we also offer Client & Build\r\n\r\nExcitement is growing with the upcoming Penlink exit (just a one-minute drive away) connecting State Highway 1 and Whangaparaao. your daily commute becomes effortless.\r\n\r\n\r\nExcellent Value 4 Bedrooms in Freehold section\r\nHouse Specification \r\nGuarantee:10 Years Master Builder Guarantee \r\nGaraga Door: Sectional Door With Auto Closer & 2 x Remotes \r\nPainting: Dulux Paint System \r\nKitchen: Designer Kitchen Granite Benchtop, Stainless Bowl \r\nAppliances: Smeg Hob Dishwasher \r\nBathrooms Heated Towel Rails, Wall mirrors\r\nAir con 1 Air conditioner in living area \r\nFloor Coverings Residential heavy duty Carpet \r\nSPC or Laminate timber Flooring \r\nWardrobe Systems in all Bedroom Wardrobes \r\nConcreted driveway Section top soiled and seeded \r\n\r\nExpress Your Interest!\r\n\r\nPLEASE NOTE: All Pictures shown are for illustration purpose only, Specified floor and land area sizes have been obtained from sources such as Vendor, RP NZ, Auckland Council (LIM) or Title documents. They have not been measured by the Salesperson or GARY QI Realty Limited. We recommend you seek your own independent legal advice if these sizes are material to your purchasing decision.",
